# Images get only what they build from (ADR-013 §2): never secrets, git history, legacy code or docs.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
legacy
docs/**
!docs/04-api/openapi.yaml
apps/api/src/generated
apps/web/public/fonts
apps/web/public/brand
apps/admin/public/fonts
apps/admin/public/brand
